# Sakrylle Admin

Mobile admin app for sub2api — admin-only: users, groups, accounts, key monitoring, dashboard trends, account ops. No end-user login flow.

## Commands

```bash
npm ci                  # Install dependencies
npm run start           # Metro (Expo Go or dev client)
npm run ios             # iOS simulator
npm run android         # Android emulator
npm run web             # Web at localhost:8081
npx tsc --noEmit        # Type check — sole quality gate
npm run proxy           # Express reverse proxy (port 8787)
npm run dev:web-proxy   # Proxy + web (CORS debugging)
npm run start:dev-client
```

No test framework. No linter. TypeScript strict mode only.

